(Conversational pipelines read left to right; ordinary formulas follow the usual order of operations.)
Let a number be called celsius
set celsius to 100 and multiply by 9 and divide by 5 and add 32
print "100 C is ", celsius, " F"

Let a number be called f
set f to 98.6
Let a number be called c
set c to (f - 32) * 5 / 9
print "98.6 F is ", rounded c to 1 places, " C"

Let a number be called a_
Let a number be called b
set a_ to 10 and set b to 20 and add 5 to a_ and b and multiply a_ and b by 2
print a_, " ", b
